## First-launch chooser

nirva-welcome-window-title = Welcome to { -brand-short-name }
nirva-welcome-heading = Choose your look
nirva-welcome-intro = This becomes your default. You can change it any time in Theme studio.
nirva-welcome-look-legend = Look
nirva-welcome-look-glass = Glass
nirva-welcome-look-glass-description = Frosted panels over soft light. Bright or dark.
nirva-welcome-look-cockpit = Cockpit
nirva-welcome-look-cockpit-description = Thin lines and instrument readouts. Dark only.
nirva-welcome-look-paper = Paper
nirva-welcome-look-paper-description = Calm pastels and serif type. Bright or dark.
nirva-welcome-mode-legend = Appearance
nirva-welcome-mode-bright = Bright
nirva-welcome-mode-dark = Dark
nirva-welcome-mode-system = Match my computer
nirva-welcome-mode-dark-only = Dark only
# Variables:
#   $look (String): the name of the chosen look, for example "Glass".
# $look (String) - The chosen look's name, such as Glass.
nirva-welcome-continue = Continue with { $look }

## Lite mode, offered on computers with little memory or few processor cores

nirva-welcome-lite = Use Lite mode
nirva-welcome-lite-description = This computer has limited memory or processor power. Lite mode drops blur and movement and lets idle tabs sleep, so the browser stays quick. You can change it any time.

## The steps of the first-run guide

nirva-welcome-step-intro = Meet { -brand-short-name }
nirva-welcome-step-look = Your look
nirva-welcome-step-privacy = Privacy
nirva-welcome-step-import = Bring your things
# $step (Number) - The current step.
# $count (Number) - How many steps there are.
nirva-welcome-step-count = Step { $step } of { $count }
nirva-welcome-back = Back
nirva-welcome-next = Continue
nirva-welcome-get-started = Get started
nirva-welcome-finish = Start browsing

nirva-welcome-intro-heading = Welcome to { -brand-short-name }
nirva-welcome-intro-lede = A browser that keeps your web on your computer. Here is what it adds.
nirva-welcome-f-timetravel = Time Travel
nirva-welcome-f-timetravel-text = Go back to how your tabs were at any moment of the last 30 days.
nirva-welcome-f-search = Search everything you read
nirva-welcome-f-search-text = Find a page by any sentence on it, not just its title.
nirva-welcome-f-library = Library
nirva-welcome-f-library-text = Keep a page as it was, with your highlights and notes, readable offline.
nirva-welcome-f-clips = Live Clips
nirva-welcome-f-clips-text = Pin one part of a page, such as a price or a score, and watch it change.
nirva-welcome-f-remix = Page Remix
nirva-welcome-f-remix-text = Hide clutter and set text size for a site, remembered next time.
nirva-welcome-f-privacy = Privacy Receipt and Trust Dial
nirva-welcome-f-privacy-text = See what was blocked on each page and set how much you trust a site.
nirva-welcome-f-burner = Burner tabs
nirva-welcome-f-burner-text = A tab that forgets everything, cookies included, when you close it.
nirva-welcome-f-tabs = Workspaces, tab rules and macros
nirva-welcome-f-tabs-text = Keep sites in their own spaces and run several actions at once.
nirva-welcome-intro-hint = Press Ctrl+K at any time to find any action by name.

nirva-welcome-privacy-heading = Choose your privacy
nirva-welcome-privacy-lede = These are on or off right now as shown. Everything stays on this computer.
nirva-welcome-protection-legend = Tracking protection
nirva-welcome-protection-standard = Standard
nirva-welcome-protection-standard-text = Blocks known trackers without breaking sites.
nirva-welcome-protection-strict = Strict
nirva-welcome-protection-strict-text = Blocks more, including fingerprinters. A few sites may not work fully.
nirva-welcome-privacy-links = Clean tracking from links
nirva-welcome-privacy-links-text = Removes tracking parts such as utm_source from links between sites.
nirva-welcome-privacy-https = Secure connections only
nirva-welcome-privacy-https-text = Always use encrypted connections, and ask before opening a site without one.
nirva-welcome-privacy-gpc = Ask sites not to sell or share my data
nirva-welcome-privacy-gpc-text = Sends the Global Privacy Control signal, which the law backs in some places.
nirva-welcome-privacy-hint = You can change these any time in Settings or from a site’s shield in the address bar.

nirva-welcome-import-heading = Bring your things
nirva-welcome-import-lede = Copy bookmarks, passwords, history and more from another browser on this computer. Your other browser is not changed.
